#~ msgid ""
#~ "But how do you sift through the amazing choices on offer? And more "
#~ "importantly, do you really trust the photographs and descriptions of the "
#~ "hotels that they have awarded themselves with the motivation of getting "
#~ "bookings? Traveler reviews can be helpful, but you need to exercise "
#~ "caution. They are often biased, sometimes out of date, and may not serve "
#~ "your interests at all. How do you know that the features that are "
#~ "important to the reviewer are important to you?"
